---
import '../styles/nova.css';
import { href } from '../lib/terms';
interface Props { title: string; description: string; current?: 'terms' | 'graph' | 'about' }
const { title, description, current } = Astro.props;
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant-TW">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Unbounded:wght@600;700;800&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+TC:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" />
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'%3E%3Crect width='16' height='16' rx='4' fill='%2305060A'/%3E%3Crect x='4' y='4' width='8' height='8' rx='2' fill='%235EEAD4'/%3E%3C/svg%3E" />
</head>
<body>
  <header class="head">
    <div class="wrap">
      <a class="brand" href={href("/")}><i aria-hidden="true"></i>AI 名詞百科</a>
      <span class="issue">第 1 版 · 2026 秋 · 100 個名詞</span>
      <nav aria-label="主要">
        <a href={href("/")} aria-current={current === 'terms' ? 'page' : undefined}>名詞</a>
        <a href={href("/graph")} aria-current={current === 'graph' ? 'page' : undefined}>關係圖</a>
        <a href={href("/about")} aria-current={current === 'about' ? 'page' : undefined}>關於</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>
  <main id="main" tabindex="-1"><slot /></main>
  <footer class="foot">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p>為在社群與 YouTube 教學裡學 AI 的人整理的名詞表。每個條目附一手來源；標 ⚠️ 的內容尚待查證。</p>
      <p>想看白話比喻與完整課程：<a href="https://dorphinai.com/">備課台</a> · <a href="https://dorphinai.com/directory/">白話AI 術語目錄</a></p>
      <p><a href="https://github.com/hsiehpinhwa/ai-glossary">GitHub 原始碼</a> · 內容最後查核 2026-10-30</p>
    </div>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
